"款项由 Apple 账户收取。订阅自动续订，除非在当前周期结束前至少 24 小时取消。符合资格的试用在 7 天后转为付费年度订阅；请提前至少 24 小时取消以避免收费。您可在 Apple 订阅设置中管理或取消。实际价格和确认条款以 App Store 为准。" = "Payment is charged to your Apple account. The subscription renews automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the current period ends. An eligible 7-day trial converts to a paid annual subscription; cancel at least 24 hours beforehand to avoid charges. Manage or cancel in Apple subscription settings. The App Store confirms the final price and terms.";
