"订阅" = "Subscription";
"行迹将事项、地点与备注保存在您的设备上。地图、天气与 Apple 购买服务按各自服务要求处理请求。AI 规划仅在您主动发起并确认披露后，将所选事项发送至您配置的服务商；API 密钥保存在系统钥匙串。\n\n本应用不建立用户账号，不出售个人数据。通知权限由您选择开启。您可删除事项或卸载应用清除本地数据；Apple 负责处理订阅交易，应用仅读取经过验证的交易权益。第三方服务的数据处理适用其政策。" = "Waypoint stores tasks, locations and notes on your device. Map, weather and Apple purchase services process requests under their own service requirements. AI planning sends selected tasks to your configured provider only when you initiate it after reviewing the disclosure. API keys are stored in system Keychain.\n\nThis app does not create user accounts or sell personal data. You choose whether to enable notifications. Delete tasks or uninstall the app to clear local data. Apple processes subscription transactions; the app reads only verified transaction entitlements. Third-party data processing is governed by their policies.";
"行迹提供地图事项管理与规划辅助。路线、天气、AI 建议仅供参考，请核实时间与实际环境。\n\n创建、编辑和规划需有效的 Apple 年度订阅或符合资格的免费试用。订阅价格由 App Store 显示；7 天试用仅适用于 Apple 判定符合资格的账户。订阅自动续订，可在 Apple 设置中取消。订阅过期后，已有事项仍可查看与导出。\n\n购买、退款和取消由 Apple 处理。请合法使用服务，不提交侵害他人权利的内容。开发者不保证外部服务始终可用。" = "Waypoint provides map-based task management and planning assistance. Routes, weather and AI suggestions are guidance only; verify times and real-world conditions.\n\nCreating, editing and planning require an active Apple annual subscription or an eligible free trial. The App Store displays the subscription price. The 7-day trial is available only to accounts Apple determines eligible. Subscriptions renew automatically and can be canceled in Apple settings. Existing tasks remain viewable and exportable after expiration.\n\nApple handles purchases, refunds and cancellations. Use services lawfully and do not submit content that infringes others' rights. External services may be unavailable.";
